icon = ExtResource("9_jqhm7")
contents = "TO DO

- Customs papers for the Rotterdam container!!
- Call the freight office about pallet 12 (AGAIN)
- Order toner + yellow post-its
- Birthday card for Margit, Friday
- Water the ficus
- Ask Nick about Wednesday :)
"
