name = "passwords.txt"
icon = ExtResource("9_jqhm7")
contents = "DON'T LOOK!!

Windows: sunshine
Email: sunshine2
Bank: sunshine3

Nick set up my computer all safe-like.
He says never to write your passwords down,
so I hid them here.
"
